/* Cocaine — updates and signature (zh-Hans) */

"Updates" = "更新";
"Check for updates automatically" = "自动检查更新";
"Once a day. Nothing is downloaded until you press Install." = "每天一次。在你按下“安装”之前不会下载任何内容。";
"Check now" = "立即检查";
"Install" = "安装";
"Download" = "下载";
"Retry" = "重试";
"Cancel" = "取消";
"Copy command" = "拷贝命令";
"Not checked yet" = "尚未检查";
"Last checked %@" = "上次检查 %@";
"Checking…" = "正在检查…";
"Cocaine is up to date" = "Cocaine 已是最新版本";
"Version %@ is available" = "版本 %@ 可用";
"Version %@: update with Homebrew (brew upgrade --cask cocaine)" = "版本 %@：请用 Homebrew 更新（brew upgrade --cask cocaine）";
"Version %@: this build can't verify updates; download it from GitHub" = "版本 %@：此版本无法验证更新；请从 GitHub 下载";
"Version %@: this build is signed ad hoc; download it from GitHub" = "版本 %@：此版本为临时签名；请从 GitHub 下载";
"Version %@: move Cocaine to Applications first" = "版本 %@：请先将 Cocaine 移到“应用程序”";
"Version %@: Cocaine's folder isn't writable; download it from GitHub" = "版本 %@：Cocaine 所在文件夹不可写；请从 GitHub 下载";
"Downloading… %d%%" = "正在下载… %d%%";
"Verifying and installing…" = "正在验证并安装…";
"You're offline." = "你处于离线状态。";
"Not enough disk space for the update." = "磁盘空间不足，无法更新。";
"The download didn't match the signed release and was deleted." = "下载内容与已签名的版本不符，已删除。";
"Refused a download from outside GitHub." = "已拒绝来自 GitHub 以外的下载。";
"Couldn't reach GitHub. Try again later." = "无法连接 GitHub。请稍后重试。";
"The new version failed the authenticity check. Nothing was installed." = "新版本未通过真实性检查。未安装任何内容。";
"The release on GitHub isn't usable for an update." = "GitHub 上的版本无法用于更新。";
"Cocaine can't write to its folder. Download the update from GitHub." = "Cocaine 无法写入其所在文件夹。请从 GitHub 下载更新。";
"The update couldn't be installed. Nothing was changed." = "无法安装更新。未做任何更改。";
"This copy's signature can't be read." = "无法读取此副本的签名。";
"Installed. Quit and reopen Cocaine to start the new version." = "已安装。退出并重新打开 Cocaine 以启动新版本。";
"Signature: missing or damaged. Reinstall Cocaine." = "签名：缺失或已损坏。请重新安装 Cocaine。";
"Signature: ad hoc. macOS forgets the permissions at every update." = "签名：临时签名。每次更新后 macOS 都会忘记权限。";
"Signature: self-signed, not verified by Apple. Permissions carry over only to updates signed with the same certificate." = "签名：自签名，未经 Apple 验证。只有使用同一证书签名的更新才会保留权限。";
"Signature: a certificate that isn't Cocaine's or Apple's." = "签名：既不属于 Cocaine 也不属于 Apple 的证书。";
"Signature: Developer ID, not notarized." = "签名：Developer ID，未经公证。";
"Signature: Developer ID, notarized by Apple." = "签名：Developer ID，已由 Apple 公证。";
